    "created_at": "2016-03-11T15:13:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-11T15:13:31Z",
    "body": "The IDL attributes that reflect as a URL are:\n\n```\nbase href\nlink href\nblockquote cite\na href\nins cite\ndel cite\nimg src\niframe src\nembed src\nobject data\nvideo poster\nsource src\ntrack src\nvideo src\narea href\ninput src\nform action\nbutton formAction\ninput formAction\nscript src\napplet object\nframe src\nframe longDesc\niframe longDesc\nimg longDesc\nimg lowsrc\nobject codeBase\n```\n\n(This would be easier to find and be confident about being correct if reflecting was using IDL syntax instead...)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
